{"_id":"693c33dfd824458807767a9f","roadmapSlug":"devsecops","nodeId":"iiOWJ7KXyHp_ovVWNmDoc","description":"# Authentication\n\nAuthentication is the process of verifying the identity of a user, device, or application attempting to access a system or resource. It confirms that the entity is who or what it claims to be, typically by requiring them to provide credentials such as a username and password, a digital certificate, or biometric data. Successful authentication grants access based on pre-defined permissions and roles.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Basic Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/basic-authentication","_id":"6a26991eac1c5fa9928acd0c"},{"type":"article","title":"Session Based Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/session-based-authentication","_id":"6a26991eac1c5fa9928acd0d"},{"type":"article","title":"Token Based Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/token-authentication","_id":"6a26991eac1c5fa9928acd0e"},{"type":"article","title":"JWT Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/jwt-authentication","_id":"6a26991eac1c5fa9928acd0f"},{"type":"article","title":"Auth - Open Authorization","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/oauth","_id":"6a26991eac1c5fa9928acd10"},{"type":"article","title":"SSO - Single Sign On","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/sso","_id":"6a26991eac1c5fa9928acd11"}],"createdAt":"2025-12-12T15:25:19.250Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-08T10:27:42.820Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/devsecops/content/iiOWJ7KXyHp_ovVWNmDoc.md"}